    priceDetail: isEnglish ? "Pioneered the 'Milk Price' ultra-low-cost plan; GLM-4-Flash is free/near-zero cost, making batch processing trivial." : "推行亲民大降价计划，GLM-4-Flash 等轻量模型直接免费或提供白菜价 API，大幅降低批量处理门槛。",
    quote: isEnglish ? "\"Without chasing viral headlines, true governance and steady enterprise execution require my foundation.\"" : "“不抢虚浮风头，真正治理家国、稳健办正事，少不了我。”",
    description: isEnglish ? "GLM is like Xun Yu: upright, dependable, and holding the imperial administration together. Backed by Tsinghua University's original foundation, its recent dramatic price cuts (accessible milk pricing) make high-speed AI accessible for everyone." : "GLM 像荀彧：清华学术底座出身，端庄稳健、内政大管家。它不靠炒作网红热搜，而是在政企合规、自主可控与实用工具调用上默默深耕。近期智谱全面推行极速降价（亲民牛奶价计划），让高质量推理以极低成本惠及大众。",
    advice: isEnglish ? "When you need a 100% sovereign tech stack, high-speed bulk batch processing, or reliable enterprise tools, appoint Xun Yu." : "需要完全自主可控的国产底座、大批量低成本跑数据管线、或者做企业级规范输出，荀彧极其稳健实惠。",
