    shortcoming: isEnglish ? "Hardcore compiler/systems code debugging is not its primary showcase; brand identity still maturing." : "硬核底层代码与算法调试不是最突出卖点；大众品牌认知还在向更多非内容创作者群体渗透。",
    priceDetail: isEnglish ? "Competitive API pricing with standout value in voice, video, and creative token economics." : "API 价格整体中档友好，在多模态声音与视频生成领域的投入产出比非常突出。",
    quote: isEnglish ? "\"The Fledgling Phoenix is here; those who truly understand creative intelligence recognize the craft.\"" : "“凤雏在此，懂多模态音视频创作的人自然懂。”",
    description: isEnglish ? "MiniMax is like Pang Tong: casual observers might initially overlook it, but creative pros utilizing voice cloning, video synthesis, and narrative Agent design know it is a genuine hidden heavyweight." : "MiniMax 很像庞统：普通用户有时会漏掉它，但做过 AI 影视、播客情感语音合成、虚拟人 Agent 的创作者都知道它的实力。它的语音拟真度与海螺视频生成在行业极具辨识度，是名副其实的“多模态奇谋隐士”。",
    advice: isEnglish ? "If your pipeline focuses on emotional audio, video generation, character agents, or long-form storytelling, consult Pang Tong." : "想要生成极其逼真自然的情感配音、制作 AI 短剧视频、或者设计富有个性的对话 Agent，找庞统最对味。",
    img: "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/PangTong.jpg",
    source: "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:PangTong.jpg",
    sourceName: isEnglish ? "Wikimedia Commons · Qing Dynasty Portrait" : "Wikimedia Commons · 清代三国绣像",
    officialUrl: "https://hailuoai.video/",
  },
  {
    rank: 10,
    ai: isEnglish ? "Tencent Hunyuan (混元)" : "腾讯混元 Hunyuan",
    family: isEnglish ? "Tencent · Hunyuan" : "腾讯 · 混元",
    character: isEnglish ? "Lu Su (鲁肃)" : "鲁肃",
    mark: "鲁",
    camp: isEnglish ? "Eastern Wu · Practical Statesman" : "东吴 · 谋臣",
    tier: isEnglish ? "T2 · Enterprise Ecosystem" : "T2 · 生态实干",
    role: isEnglish ? "Quiet on social feeds, but deeply embedded across WeChat, docs, and corporate pipelines." : "忠厚重臣，家底殷实；默默融入微信与企业生态，稳定可靠的实干管家。",
    tags: isEnglish ? ["WeChat Integration", "Enterprise Docs", "Reliable Baseline", "Cloud Pipeline"] : ["微信生态互通", "企业办公文档", "底盘扎实", "腾讯云管线"],
